::ENG4_U06_PRE_Q01::[MLA.ENG4.C.01] Unit 6 pretest scenario: A final project about career certification access must include oral explanation, digital slides, research support, multimedia publication, source credits, and an audience-ready sharing format. Which option is strongest? {
=A. Present a focused claim with credible evidence and clear audience-centered organization.#Correct. This answer best applies Unit 6 communication skills with clear reasoning, evidence, audience awareness, and publication readiness.
~B. Choose the option with the most decoration.#Incorrect. Review the Unit 6 lesson content and choose the option that best supports audience, credibility, access, coherence, and professional communication.
~C. Use technical language without defining it for the audience.#Incorrect. Review the Unit 6 lesson content and choose the option that best supports audience, credibility, access, coherence, and professional communication.
~D. Share the product before checking source credits or accessibility.#Incorrect. Review the Unit 6 lesson content and choose the option that best supports audience, credibility, access, coherence, and professional communication.
}

